[{"title":"又登碧云亭感怀三十首 其二十九","author":"吴芾","text":"晚上危亭懒举头，竹椽芦屋亦堪羞。\n我将一变成雄观，长与邦人作宴游。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43220,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"又登碧云亭感怀三十首 其二十八","author":"吴芾","text":"晚上危亭忆隐居，高情逸气古人无。\n横山祇有精庐在，无复书堂旧药炉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43221,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"又登碧云亭感怀三十首 其二十七","author":"吴芾","text":"晚上危亭忆令威，凌虚山上悟玄机。\n丹成不见升腾迹，徒想当年化鹤飞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43222,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"又登碧云亭感怀三十首 其二十六","author":"吴芾","text":"晚上危亭忆孟君，龙山一醉见天真。\n堪嗟东道空遗臭，争似尊前落帽人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43223,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"又登碧云亭感怀三十首 其二十五","author":"吴芾","text":"晚上危亭望石城，楚君曾向此间兴。\n城池芜没人何在，只有空山几个僧。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43224,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"又登碧云亭感怀三十首 其二十四","author":"吴芾","text":"晚上危亭想谪仙，孤坟寂寂锁寒烟。\n高风直节谁能继，只有诗篇后代传。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43225,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"又登碧云亭感怀三十首 其二十三","author":"吴芾","text":"晚上危亭一凭栏，青青最爱谢家山。\n谢公陈迹虽磨灭，馀韵遗风尚可攀。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43226,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"又登碧云亭感怀三十首 其二十二","author":"吴芾","text":"晚上危亭景色饶，眼中突兀是凌歊。\n三千粉黛知何许，祇有江山锁寂寥。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43227,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"又登碧云亭感怀三十首 其二十一","author":"吴芾","text":"晚上危亭望大江，天教千古作金汤。\n中流击楫人何在，徒感兴亡对夕阳。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43228,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"又登碧云亭感怀三十首 其二十","author":"吴芾","text":"晚上危亭与客同，话头只是说山中。\n老来百念消磨尽，只有归心羡暮鸿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43229,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"又登碧云亭感怀三十首 其十九","author":"吴芾","text":"晚上危亭力已疲，胡为归计尚迟迟。\n如今若便休官去，也胜当初未有时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43230,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"又登碧云亭感怀三十首 其十八","author":"吴芾","text":"晚上危亭为少留，亭前暝色已供愁。\n更听画角声悲壮，愈使愁人厌远游。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43231,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"又登碧云亭感怀三十首 其十七","author":"吴芾","text":"晚上危亭待月生，云头俄涌一轮明。\n终朝汩没尘埃里，对此身心觉顿清。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43232,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"又登碧云亭感怀三十首 其十六","author":"吴芾","text":"晚上危亭避郁蒸，风生两腋觉身轻。\n更筹只是催归去，不到城头月未生。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43233,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"又登碧云亭感怀三十首 其十五","author":"吴芾","text":"晚上危亭览物华，斜阳影里度归鸦。\n暮山隔断乡关路，矫首临风眼欲花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43234,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"又登碧云亭感怀三十首 其十四","author":"吴芾","text":"晚上危亭望远山，望中有水亦回环。\n终然不似吾庐好，上下山光水色间。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43235,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"又登碧云亭感怀三十首 其十三","author":"吴芾","text":"晚上危亭咏式微，封章再上未容归。\n羡他白鹭凌风去，却向山前自在飞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43236,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"又登碧云亭感怀三十首 其十二","author":"吴芾","text":"晚上危亭望彼苍，时时飞电迸流光。\n嗟人生世须臾里，未必能如电久长。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43237,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"又登碧云亭感怀三十首 其十一","author":"吴芾","text":"晚上危亭顾四隅，小松环绕几千株。\n他年黛色侵天去，应记栽时是老夫。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43238,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"又登碧云亭感怀三十首 其十","author":"吴芾","text":"晚上危亭指顾间，羊牛来下鸟飞还。\n细思物理须知止，何用区区祇强颜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43239,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"又登碧云亭感怀三十首 其九","author":"吴芾","text":"晚上危亭一解颜，公馀偷得半时闲。\n未能投绂寻归路，聊复衔杯对好山。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43240,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"又登碧云亭感怀三十首 其八","author":"吴芾","text":"晚上危亭兴未穷，仰看星斗已悬空。\n可怜熠耀飞撩乱，也欲争光迥野中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43241,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"又登碧云亭感怀三十首 其七","author":"吴芾","text":"晚上危亭侧耳听，新蝉噪罢乱蛙鸣。\n老来只是便幽静，颇厌人间强聒声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43242,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"又登碧云亭感怀三十首 其六","author":"吴芾","text":"晚上危亭逸兴多，却寻小艇下烟波。\n酒狂聊作碧筒饮，折尽花间几柄荷。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43243,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"又登碧云亭感怀三十首 其五","author":"吴芾","text":"晚上危亭看绿荷，风翻荷叶欲藏花。\n使君要见红妆面，莫放碧云重叠遮。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43244,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"又登碧云亭感怀三十首 其四","author":"吴芾","text":"晚上危亭瞰野塘，藕花无数散清香。\n若为荷叶分青绿，一半红妆半淡妆。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43245,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"又登碧云亭感怀三十首 其三","author":"吴芾","text":"晚上危亭喜作晴，亦思郊外一闲行。\n无端骑从相遮护，不放山翁适野情。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43246,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"又登碧云亭感怀三十首 其二","author":"吴芾","text":"晚上危亭眼暂明，风烟浓淡媚郊坰。\n个中妙处吟难尽，分付人间作画屏。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43247,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"又登碧云亭感怀三十首 其一","author":"吴芾","text":"晚上危亭暑气清，薰风微动入疏棂。\n重重草树高低绿，叠叠峰峦远近青。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43248,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"三七侄入新屋 其二","author":"吴芾","text":"我昔行年近六旬，辛勤才有屋容身。\n汝成广厦年方壮，端是吾家有福人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43249,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"三七侄入新屋 其一","author":"吴芾","text":"华屋新成集贺宾，门阑盛事一番新。\n愿言积德高于屋，屋下长存百岁人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43250,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"三三径","author":"吴芾","text":"种成松竹与江梅，杖履相过日几回。\n莫谓个中三友足，也须更许老夫来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43251,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"上七斋素不饮","author":"吴芾","text":"人日晴天万里开，自应一笑上春台。\n清斋偶阻花前醉，且把茶瓯当酒杯。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43252,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"久拟重阳一登龙山以荒榛峭壁无容足之地欲访昔人风帽遗址竟不可得遂领客之凌歊偶成四绝 其四","author":"吴芾","text":"宦情一似秋容薄，归兴浑如酒味浓。\n台上望乡何处是，夕阳影里暮山重。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43253,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"久拟重阳一登龙山以荒榛峭壁无容足之地欲访昔人风帽遗址竟不可得遂领客之凌歊偶成四绝 其一","author":"吴芾","text":"登高自古说龙山，拟访遗踪去路难。\n赖有凌歊台尚在，不妨怀古凭栏干。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43254,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"久拟重阳一登龙山以荒榛峭壁无容足之地欲访昔人风帽遗址竟不可得遂领客之凌歊偶成四绝 其三","author":"吴芾","text":"下车日日欲登台，直到重阳始一来。\n好对江山拚酩酊，此怀能得几时开。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43255,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"久拟重阳一登龙山以荒榛峭壁无容足之地欲访昔人风帽遗址竟不可得遂领客之凌歊偶成四绝 其二","author":"吴芾","text":"当年宋武筑凌歊，人去台空气尚豪。\n欲吊兴亡无处问，且凭茱菊荐芳醪。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43256,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"久欲乞归未得一日蒙恩放归不胜欣喜涂中得十五首 其十五","author":"吴芾","text":"淡烟斜日媚郊原，中有人家似辋川。\n地侧忽惊车马过，三三两两竹篱边。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43257,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"久欲乞归未得一日蒙恩放归不胜欣喜涂中得十五首 其十四","author":"吴芾","text":"兀兀篮舆足欲拳，聊扶藜杖步山边。\n招提此去无多地，且就僧房借榻眠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43258,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"久欲乞归未得一日蒙恩放归不胜欣喜涂中得十五首 其十三","author":"吴芾","text":"路傍遥见一山居，欢喜犹如见故庐。\n见似故庐犹自喜，如今到后喜何如。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43259,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"久欲乞归未得一日蒙恩放归不胜欣喜涂中得十五首 其十二","author":"吴芾","text":"荒墟忽见翠成堆，错认青山入眼来。\n元是松林如此好，不妨归去更勤栽。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43260,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"久欲乞归未得一日蒙恩放归不胜欣喜涂中得十五首 其十一","author":"吴芾","text":"无日无时不念归，此心宜有鬼神知。\n如今已作终焉计，寄语山灵莫勒移。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43261,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"久欲乞归未得一日蒙恩放归不胜欣喜涂中得十五首 其十","author":"吴芾","text":"欲寒还暖雨还晴，极目秋郊景色明。\n应是此归天亦喜，故将风日作人情。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43262,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"久欲乞归未得一日蒙恩放归不胜欣喜涂中得十五首 其九","author":"吴芾","text":"夹道乔松几度春，青青黛色四时新。\n当时若尽荒郊种，万顷清阴更可人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43263,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"久欲乞归未得一日蒙恩放归不胜欣喜涂中得十五首 其八","author":"吴芾","text":"记得年时入境来，老分阃寄惧非才。\n今朝遂出洪都去，笑指故山真快哉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43264,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"久欲乞归未得一日蒙恩放归不胜欣喜涂中得十五首 其七","author":"吴芾","text":"去年来见荷初败，今岁归逢菊已残。\n残菊败荷浑似我，纵馀芬馥岂堪观。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43265,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"久欲乞归未得一日蒙恩放归不胜欣喜涂中得十五首 其六","author":"吴芾","text":"邦人送我说殷勤，自愧初无德及民。\n若更踌躇不归去，猿惊鹤怨亦愁人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43266,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"久欲乞归未得一日蒙恩放归不胜欣喜涂中得十五首 其五","author":"吴芾","text":"老夫非是厌洪都，正恐沉迷失故吾。\n纵使东湖花似锦，不如归对小西湖。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43267,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"久欲乞归未得一日蒙恩放归不胜欣喜涂中得十五首 其四","author":"吴芾","text":"来时似觉秋犹热，去日忽惊秋已深。\n一去一来何所益，不如归去旧园林。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43268,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"久欲乞归未得一日蒙恩放归不胜欣喜涂中得十五首 其三","author":"吴芾","text":"东去匆匆不暂停，我于此地岂无情。\n祇缘衰病归心切，不惮崎岖趁晓程。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43269,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"久欲乞归未得一日蒙恩放归不胜欣喜涂中得十五首 其二","author":"吴芾","text":"我病只宜投绂去，君恩却许奉祠归。\n小人报国非无志，正恐叨踰触祸机。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43270,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"久欲乞归未得一日蒙恩放归不胜欣喜涂中得十五首 其一","author":"吴芾","text":"今日方行第一程，看来已觉此身轻。\n若还归到湖山里，何啻乘云上玉清。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43271,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"子肃见示和篇复次韵","author":"吴芾","text":"花到浓时自有香，未逢真赏亦堪伤。\n今朝渗鼻浑如许，岂是兹花返故常。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43272,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"小有洞","author":"吴芾","text":"世人竞蜗角，终日汩尘缘。\n谁谓名园内，深藏小洞天。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43273,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"山居上元","author":"吴芾","text":"未能免俗强随缘，聊挂灯毬记上元。\n席上虽无罗绮绕，游人来往亦喧喧。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43274,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"予赴官当涂绝江而西夜宿慈严秉烛游三洞时主僧出示诸公留题因用乐天韵成一绝","author":"吴芾","text":"洞中风水锁松筠，一见都忘老病身。\n安得结茅长此住，临风临水作闲人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43275,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"云龛","author":"吴芾","text":"君将富贵等浮云，却许白云来就宿。\n静处何妨共一龛，免教随手翻还复。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43276,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"五月七日晚登碧云亭有感","author":"吴芾","text":"连岁芙蕖照眼明，今年荷叶又青青。\n老夫去此无他恋，祇忆看花水上亭。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43277,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"今日春色可佳乘兴谒许倅因成小诗","author":"吴芾","text":"春入风流别乘家，满园桃李掞春华。\n殷勤为我倾醇酎，要看庭前百树花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43278,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"元夕即席呈郭次张","author":"吴芾","text":"过了元宵到晓钟，一年乐事又成空。\n杯行不用深辞醉，明日君西我亦东。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43279,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"六月二十一日早行十六首 其十六","author":"吴芾","text":"暂归祇欲见湖山，多谢亲朋日往还。\n但愧年衰筋骨惫，将迎容我片时閒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43280,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"六月二十一日早行十六首 其十五","author":"吴芾","text":"只爱湖光似镜平，那知汹涌作潮鸣。\n直疑身在江船上，夜半更闻风雨声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43281,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"六月二十一日早行十六首 其十四","author":"吴芾","text":"谩来水上结危亭，更凭栏干听水声。\n洗得肺肝清似水，莫言亭下水无情。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43282,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"六月二十一日早行十六首 其十三","author":"吴芾","text":"竹间幽径喜相通，花下清阴苦未浓。\n说与园丁勤灌溉，我归要此养疏慵。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43283,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"六月二十一日早行十六首 其十二","author":"吴芾","text":"不见湖山两阅冬，相思千里梦魂通。\n今宵烛下匆匆看，犹恐归来似梦中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43284,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"六月二十一日早行十六首 其十一","author":"吴芾","text":"出入乡关四十期，劳人迎送每惭之。\n今朝单骑归来速，且喜乡人都不知。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43285,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"六月二十一日早行十六首 其十","author":"吴芾","text":"东望吾庐百里间，二年别去一朝还。\n虽然未遂归休意，且对湖山一解颜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43286,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"六月二十一日早行十六首 其九","author":"吴芾","text":"蝉噪园林处处同，此蝉鸣处颤春风。\n祇应寒饿全无力，吟不成声喙已穷。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43287,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"六月二十一日早行十六首 其八","author":"吴芾","text":"篮舆亟欲到柴门，终日驱驰亦苦辛。\n野外莫嫌车骑少，笙歌两部自随人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43288,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"六月二十一日早行十六首 其七","author":"吴芾","text":"古寺经行知几回，山僧又见我重来。\n暮年欲作终焉计，不得归休只自哀。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43289,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"六月二十一日早行十六首 其六","author":"吴芾","text":"雨后西山气象新，野田高下水津津。\n晚来弛担临风坐，聒耳蛙声更可人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43290,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"六月二十一日早行十六首 其五","author":"吴芾","text":"欲挂衣冠已上章，更令冲冒去南昌。\n南昌纵有佳山水，争似安閒在故乡。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43291,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"六月二十一日早行十六首 其四","author":"吴芾","text":"为忆湖山且暂归，此心不是要追时。\n君恩留我非由己，寄语山灵莫勒移。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43292,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"六月二十一日早行十六首 其三","author":"吴芾","text":"病躯终日困骄阳，正虑行行去路长。\n多谢天公怜此意，时飞疏雨作清凉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43293,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}}]